  "adaptations": [
    "Nats.Value.get_list_array delegates to Get.list for the pinned list-backed runtime.",
    "A list-backed Builtin.Value_array compatibility module implements only of_list, init, length, sub and replace_slice.",
    "Wrap and Construct qualify their Value_array calls through Builtin.Value_array.",
    "Library Dune files replace upstream CLI, JS and regression targets with the numeric dependency closure and hook library."
